$t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ Consequently, $y\\ge 0.$\n\nTherefore, the ranges are $x\\le \\frac{25}{4}$ and $y\\ge 0.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186381333 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cddc940d-2185-569c-a62b-b507e95d3c35" :knowledge-point/title "Determining the Range of a Parametric Equation Defined in Terms of Trigonometric Functions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e547d42b-5010-539b-8b5d-ee823a2cdab7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381335} {:answer/id #uuid "633ac69a-e98e-5c19-8f7e-9096dcd3f584" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381336}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e547d42b-5010-539b-8b5d-ee823a2cdab7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381335} :answer-field/id #uuid "00cff288-3156-5802-939b-97546d226561" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381334} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ce95018d-def6-5439-bb22-d1c65d56ac28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381338}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ce95018d-def6-5439-bb22-d1c65d56ac28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\le" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381338} :answer-field/id #uuid "8d8381de-0abc-57cc-81b8-10085e11a0ce" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381337} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "09c2a06d-1c91-52c2-936c-0b0029e10bb6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381340}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "09c2a06d-1c91-52c2-936c-0b0029e10bb6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381340} :answer-field/id #uuid "75badb3b-5f3b-5a6c-9f5d-8