\theta -2,\\,y=-5\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,\\,0\\le \\theta <2\\pi ,\n$$\n\nwhat are the ranges of $x$ and $y?$\n\nThe range of $x$ is \n{{field-1}}\n$\\le x$\n{{field-2}}{{field-3}}.\n\nThe range of $y$ is \n{{field-4}}{{field-5}}\n$y\\le $\n{{field-6}}." :question/worked-solution "Let's consider each variable in turn.\n\n- To find the range of $x,$ notice that for $0\\le \\theta <2\\pi ,$ \nwe have $-1\\le \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\le 1.$ Consequently,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\le \\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\le 1 \\\\ -3 & \\le 3\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\le 3 \\\\ -3-2 & \\le 3\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -2\\le 3-2 \\\\ -5 & \\le x\\le 1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can conclude that $-5\\le x\\le 1.$\n\n- To find the range of $y,$ notice that for $0\\le \\theta <2\\pi ,$ \nwe have $-1\\le \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\le 1.$ Consequently,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\le \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\le 1 \\\\ 5 & \\text{ }\\ge -5\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\text{ }\\ge -5 \\\\ -5 & \\le -5\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\le 5 \\\\ -5 & \\le y\\le 5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can conclude that $-5\\le y\\le 5.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186381347 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "bbf50e27-a8c3-52e7-be21-5d7ed61e5512" :knowledge-point/title "Filling a Table of Values for a Parametric Curve"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a32257b5-ca74-59c5-a2d7-d4ec37255d25" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381349}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a32257b5-ca74-59c5-a2d7-d4ec37255d25" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381349} :answer-field/id #uuid "c791634c-6a59-59f7-8f05-4fdc4fff0bb4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186381348} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16c5561e-82e7-5789-82b3-a291ee13d478" :answer/type 